  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7396c54e-3c4c-4e69-bb4f-f22b34c802e7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"302\"></p>\n<p>Это набор текстур, делающий Mizuno совместимым с <strong><em>[Let's Do] Bakery</em></strong>.<strong><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Требуется:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-bakery-farm-charm-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Bakery</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Все дополнения к Mizuno.<br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno Better Leaves</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unofficial Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Connected Texture</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x Fresh Animations</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Dark Mode</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Connected Glass</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-eating-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Eating Animation</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"f